          "filename": "Huntingtower Castle. - geograph.org.uk - 159048.jpg",
          "caption": "Huntingtower Castle. This 15th Century castle, formerly known as Ruthven Castle, has two tower houses joined by a lower building. The space between is sometimes called the \" Maiden's Leap\". The castle has been restored and is sometimes hired for weddings (note the piper on the battlements!).",
          "alt": "Huntingtower Castle. This 15th Century castle, formerly known as Ruthven Castle, has two tower houses joined by a lower building. The space between is sometimes called the \" Maiden's Leap\". The castle has been restored and is sometimes hired for weddings (note the piper on the battlements!).",
